    "post_text": [
      "Welcome to Rosen Inn at Pointe Orlando, a family-friendly hotel located on Orlando's International Drive. Our guests enjoy convenient access to nearby Walt Disney World, Universal Orlando, and Epic Universe.",
      "Ready to make the most of your Orlando vacation? 🌴✨ Here are 3 reasons to stay at Rosen Inn at Pointe Orlando:\n\n📍 1. Convenient Location - Stay minutes from Orlando’s top attractions, shopping, dining, and entertainment, with easy access to Universal Orlando Resort, International Drive, and the Orange County Convention Center.\n\n🍔 2. On-Site Dining - Enjoy delicious meals, snacks, and drinks without leaving the hotel, so you can spend more time enjoying your vacation.\n\n💸 3. Affordable Rates & Great Value - Comfortable accommodations, great amenities, and budget-friendly rates make it easy to experience more of Orlando for less.\n\nYour Orlando adventure starts here. ✨ Book your stay and see why so many travelers choose Rosen Inn at Pointe Orlando!"
